  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>在 Forge 上截取高质量截图</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">默认情况下，按 F4 截取高分辨率截图，按 F6 打开设置。所有参数均可自定义。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>设置界面</strong>&nbsp;</h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fs66Rmi.png\" alt=\"Forgeshot 设置界面\" width=\"435\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>预览</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QpqvSDU.jpg\" alt=\"16K 图片\" width=\"638\" height=\"359\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fQpqvSDU.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处查看 16K (15360x8640) 图片</a></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>对比</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tOdz8xU.png6699f9846ca\" alt=\"全高清与 4K 对比\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>图片来源：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/donepi_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Donepi</a></em></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>致谢</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">图标与设计灵感来自 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/donepi_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Donepi</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">受 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabrishot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabrishot</a> 启发</span></p>",
